'''Sami''',<ref name="Sami DB" /> also known as '''SP-39''',<ref name="Cavalry">{{TBB|The Cavalry Has Arrived}}</ref> was a [[Youngling|young]] [[Gender|female]]<ref name="Sami DB" /> [[Pantoran]] who was kept as a [[prisoner]] inside [[Tantiss vault|the vault]] of [[Tantiss Base]] along with [[Eva]] and [[Jax (Mirialan)|Jax]], two other children who had a high [[Midi-chlorian|M-count]].<ref name="Into the Breach" /> Worn down by her [[time]] in captivity, she was quiet and cautious.<ref name="Sami DB" /> With the arrival of the infant [[Bayrn]], Sami became his primary caregiver. She, along with the other children, would eventually escape with the aid of [[Doctor]] [[Emerie Karr]] and the [[Clone Force 99|Bad Batch]].<ref name="Cavalry" />

